    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d176-a2">

                <pb facs="0290" n="216" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg216"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Cespedes to Mr.
                        Rice</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 405.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States of Colombia, Sovereign
                                State of Panama, Office of the Prefect of the Department</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Colon</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-11-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 11, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The alcalde of this district, who is at present engaged in the investigation of
                    the occurrence which took place last night—that is to say, the death inflicted
                    by a soldier of the United States ship of war James Adger, and native of
                    Jamaica, by a gunshot—informs me, in an official note, that he requires the said
                    soldier to appear this day at his office for the elucidation of the occurrence
                    in question. I bring this to your knowledge in order that you may be pleased to
                    apply to the captain of the above-named steamer to cause this soldier to appear
                    at the office of the alcalde to make his declaration. It will not be out of
                    place to call your attention to the character of the offence which has been
                    committed on Colombian territory, in order that you may cause the demands of
                    public justice to be complied with.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOSÉ A. CESPEDES.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. W. Rice,</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >United States Consul, Aspinwall.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
